# Canonical starting puzzle: every executable byte is a literal binary token.
11111010 # instruction | CLI | Mask interrupts so the final halt stays stopped.
10111000 00101001 00000000 # instruction | MOV AX,41 | B8 chooses AX; 29 00 is the little-endian immediate 41.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Stop with the current register value.
